<title>GREECE: Greek/Bund gap widens to 362 bps, 266 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>Greek/Bund gap widens to 362 bps, 266 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds rose to 362 basis points from 357 on Monday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also widened to 266 basis points from 252 on Monday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.17%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.55%	362	357 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.42%	375	367 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.51%	266	252 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.30%	287	282 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.23%	294	288 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.16%	201	201 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.37%	280	276 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0947 GMT.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
